<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Blade Master Sun Stroke HMB</Major>
    <Description>When you are at "draw stance" and your party need "HMB (Hongmoon Block)". 
"HMB" can be difficult to use sometimes.
 Because you are switching to "basic stance" from "draw stance" with using "block skill(1) + F", 
If you make mistake or if you are not fast enough, your "Sun Stroke(Tab)" skill is not resetting. 
That's big problem for your dps. 
This macro makes you use "hmb" when you are at "draw stance" and switch from "basic stance" to "draw stance" again.

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 120
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 120
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 120
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 120
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 120
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 120</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Blade &amp; Soul</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>